							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							well guys today is the day...<br />GL to everyone.&nbsp; Hope to see alot of your shining and new faces in Norrath... remember im not as bad as i sound in the game =)&nbsp; i can be a total asshat.. pardon the lingo.. but eh i just like people to do their jobs and play their class...&nbsp; other than that.. hope to see you in on Quellious/Rodcet Nife server!<br /><br />Glad we are finally getting this merger overwith... so we can see how its going to go.. yes im very impatient.. i hate waiting around for stuff to happen.. id rather see it happen fast.<br /><br />GL and Cya in game.
